<title>USA: U.S. corn weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. corn major net sales activity in the week ended Sept 19 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p> Net Sales:	 1996/97		     1997/98</p>
<p>  Japan	    228,500			    Nil</p>
<p>  S Korea	  102,800</p>
<p>  Mexico	    84,400</p>
<p>  Saudi Arabia    60,000</p>
<p>  Taiwan	    57,000</p>
<p>  Unknown	   47,100</p>
<p>  Egypt	     35,000</p>
<p>Sales of 786,100 tonnes were 4 percent below the previous week.</p>
<p>Exports of 606,100 tonnes were 38 percent above the previoius week, and 28 percent above the four-week average.</p>
<p>Primary export destinations: Japan, Taiwan, S Korea, Egypt and Mexico.</p>
</text>
